Package: sheng-tablet-mode
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: mumuxiao722 <zy349931@163.com>
Depends: python3, python3-evdev
Description: GNOME auto-rotation fix for Xiaomi Pad 6S Pro
 Deterministically expose SW_TABLET_MODE to GNOME so that auto-rotation
 works on the Xiaomi Pad 6S Pro (sheng). The physical gpio-keys hall
 sensor is hidden from libinput and a virtual uinput switch reports
 tablet mode once the real user session starts, which unlocks mutter's
 panel-orientation management. Cover close/open blanking is handled via
 org.gnome.Mutter.DisplayConfig PowerSaveMode.
 .
 GNOME-only support package. Sources:
 https://github.com/mumuxiao722/sheng-tablet-mode
